        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-30T09:23:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I needed to know this so that I can advise my friend who will be attending some conventions.</p>\n<p>Which promo will be given free (or not) with which game?</p>\n<p>Things we know:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Young Legacy free with 1st ed core game. Will it still be given free with 2nd ed core game?</li>\n<li>Rook City Wraith free with Rook City.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Things we still don’t know:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Ra promo free with Infernal Relics?</li>\n<li>Fanatic promo free with Infernal Relics?</li>\n<li>Omnitron promo free(?) with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics?</li>\n<li>Baron Blade promo free(?) with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics?</li>\n<li>Unity promo (very unlikely) free(?)  with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics? Only on online store?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Thanks for letting us know.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:25.284Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 5693,
        "topic_slug": "promo-availability",
        "display_username": "ketigid",
        "primary_group_name": null,
