        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I needed to know this so that I can advise my friend who will be attending some conventions.\n\nWhich promo will be given free (or not) with which game?\n\nThings we know:\n1. Young Legacy free with 1st ed core game. Will it still be given free with 2nd ed core game?\n2. Rook City Wraith free with Rook City.\n\nThings we still don't know:\n1. Ra promo free with Infernal Relics?\n2. Fanatic promo free with Infernal Relics?\n3. Omnitron promo free(?) with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics?\n4. Baron Blade promo free(?) with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics?\n5. Unity promo (very unlikely) free(?)  with 2nd ed core game? Infernal Relics? Only on online store?\n\nThanks for letting us know.",
