        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/f14d63/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-30T18:37:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ve always taken the promos as a “while supplies last” kind of thing.</p>\n<p>I’m willing to bet that Young Legacy and Rook City Wraith won’t be available again after IR’s kickstarter, due to the amount left and people interested. I don’t think any information has been given on how to get the most recently unlocked promos, outside or after the kickstarter. Unity, I’m sure, will be sold afterwards (possibly for a limited time).</p>",
